                                <p><p>Mohammad ka gharana..(4)<br />
Aise hote hai Mohammad ke gharane wale..(2)<br />
noke naiza pe bhi qur&#39;aan..(2), sunane wale<br />
Aise hote hai Mohammad ke gharane wale..(2)</p>

<p>1. Ye jafao&#39;n ke sile mein bhi dua dete hai<br />
