<p>2. Ek mashkeeze mein darya ko utha lete hai<br />
ye to khud pyaas ko darya ki bujha dete hai<br />
pyaase darya se palat kar hai..(2), ye aane wale<br />
Aise hote hai Mohammad ke gharane wale..(2)</p>

<p>3. Baat ho haqq ki to ye maut se ghabrate nahi<br />
