budhe kaandho&#39; pe jawaa&#39;n laash..(2), uthane wale<br />
Aise hote hai Mohammad ke gharane wale..(2)</p>

<p>5. Door tareekiye aalam ko kiya shahe zaman<br />
naam e ahmed ke diye karke dilo&#39;n mein roshan<br />
apne khaime ke charagho ko..(2), bujhane wale<br />
Aise hote hai Mohammad ke gharane wale..(2)</p>

<p>6. Laashe paamaal hui qaidi bane ghar bhi jala<br />
