tanha nau laakh ke lashkar ko..(2), harane wale<br />
Aise hote hai Mohammad ke gharane wale..(2)</p>

<p>7. Humne yu meesum o salman baqa paayi hai<br />
chauda sadiyo&#39;n se jo naslo&#39;n mein azaa aayi hai<br />
nasl dar nasl azadaaar..(2), banane wale<br />
Aise hote hai Mohammad ke gharane wale..(2)<br />
Mohammad ka gharana..(2)</p>
